{"type":"message","id":"bc5bb7a9","parentId":"f43e62fb","timestamp":"2026-03-12T22:22:02.986Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:f6b9edc7-5375-4a0a-b88b-3989ad8ab3eb skill-evolution-hourly] 执行自动进化任务：1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）；2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能；3. 安装有价值的技能；4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\nCurrent time: Friday, March 13th, 2026 — 6:22 AM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773354122985}}
{"type":"message","id":"5ab147d8","parentId":"bc5bb7a9","timestamp":"2026-03-12T22:22:11.328Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我需要执行一个自动进化任务。让我理解一下要求：\n\n1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）\n2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\n\n首先，我需要使用 ClawHub CLI 来搜索技能。让我查看一下 clawhub skill 的说明。\n\n根据可用的技能，我看到有 \"clawhub\" 技能，它说\"Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com\"。\n\n让我先读取 clawhub 技能的 SKILL.md 文件来了解如何使用它。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来执行这个自动进化任务。首先让我查看 ClawHub CLI 的使用方法。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_95ac5e2fb38b40f0a50d1cbc","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":12705,"output":214,"cacheRead":2752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15671,"cost":{"input":0.012705,"output":0.0006848000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0005504,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013940199999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773354122985}}
{"type":"message","id":"90e4bc6a","parentId":"5ab147d8","timestamp":"2026-03-12T22:22:11.334Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_95ac5e2fb38b40f0a50d1cbc","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: clawhub\ndescription: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"node\",\n              \"kind\": \"node\",\n              \"package\": \"clawhub\",\n              \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install ClawHub CLI (npm)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# ClawHub CLI\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n\nAuth (publish)\n\n```bash\nclawhub login\nclawhub whoami\n```\n\nSearch\n\n```bash\nclawhub search \"postgres backups\"\n```\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nclawhub install my-skill\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\n```\n\nUpdate (hash-based match + upgrade)\n\n```bash\nclawhub update my-skill\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\nclawhub update --all\nclawhub update my-skill --force\nclawhub update --all --no-input --force\n```\n\nList\n\n```bash\nclawhub list\n```\n\nPublish\n\n```bash\nclawhub publish ./my-skill --slug my-skill --name \"My Skill\" --version 1.2.0 --changelog \"Fixes + docs\"\n```\n\nNotes\n\n- Default registry: https://clawhub.com (override with CLAWHUB_REGISTRY or --registry)\n- Default workdir: cwd (falls back to OpenClaw workspace); install dir: ./skills (override with --workdir / --dir / CLAWHUB_WORKDIR)\n- Update command hashes local files, resolves matching version, and upgrades to latest unless --version is set\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773354131332}}
{"type":"message","id":"be0954ec","parentId":"90e4bc6a","timestamp":"2026-03-12T22:22:17.496Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，现在我了解了如何使用 ClawHub CLI。让我开始搜索技能。我需要：\n1. 搜索多个关键词\n2. 查看搜索结果\n3. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n4. 安装有价值的技能\n5. 生成报告\n\n让我开始搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在开始搜索 ClawHub 上的高效技能："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b11dea49cd504a8ea5876d9f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search calendar --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search calendar"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4d00ee32428e47898bc3deea","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search task --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search task"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b29431a3f2a641238445f2d1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search document --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search document"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4179f34467584fbeb9493f9f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search meeting --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search meeting"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":693,"output":194,"cacheRead":15424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16311,"cost":{"input":0.0006929999999999999,"output":0.0006208,"cacheRead":0.0030848000000000004,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.004398600000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773354131334}}
